Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.48,0:00:11.19,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:35.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meet again. You wanna play.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.47,0:00:38.68,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1\alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:39.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The music. I'll give up. No\None. Open the world. Let the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.58,0:00:40.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,truth make a difference
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't applaud yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to game your world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:55.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be so high-tension I can't let you\Nknow I can't speak anymore. Love me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.54,0:00:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me. Go ahead and set me\Ndown. Love me heavy. Creep
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.94,0:01:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it Jar Love me Love me I'm so making my\Nday Show me! Show me! Thinking who Isek
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.28,0:01:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Edit. Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:17.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forget.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.98,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 56\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 3
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.73,0:01:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before he can activate his\Ntechnique, I have to beat him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but all acts of violence are\Nindefinitely prohibited in this space.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.90,0:01:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.46,0:02:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.10,0:02:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, harmful remarks\Nare the exception.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.84,0:02:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.96,0:02:20.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The defendant, Yuji Itadori, stands\Naccused of committing the following crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.72,0:02:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On July 16th, 2017,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the defendant entered Maji Vegas Pachinko\NParlor, Sendai City, Miyagi Prefecture,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.20,0:02:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,despite being under the\Nlegal age of 18 at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.70,0:02:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.38,0:02:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Within this domain, Judge Man knows all\Nwho've entered and everything they've done.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.51,0:02:51.77,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,18)\an8\fs12\c&H000000&\3c&HD2D1DA&\shad0\bord1}Um... Well...\NUh... See...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:45.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't worry yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.24,0:02:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That information has\Nnever been shared with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.08,0:02:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The verdict will be decided solely\Nby the arguments we present today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.10,0:02:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the exception of this evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.46,0:02:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:02:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd you get that from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.68,0:03:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the evidence Judge Man\Nprovided and submitted for this case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no guarantee that this will confirm\Nthe charges alleged against you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.52,0:03:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, it will\Nremain a secret to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.42,0:03:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, you must\Nnow present your argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.20,0:03:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your goal is to clear suspicion and\Nwin an innocent verdict from Judge Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A court trial technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.48,0:03:25.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.86,0:03:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he really was a defense lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.54,0:03:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But isn't he acting\Nlike a prosecutor here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.92,0:03:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma is a modern sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This domain is like what\NTengen talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.26,0:03:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domains used to be a much\Nmore standard skill set for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.24,0:03:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers to use against\Ntheir enemies in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.18,0:03:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because they lacked the guaranteed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kill element that applies\Nto today's attacks.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.17,0:03:51.79,Onscreen1,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,110)\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H000000&\bord2\shad0}Guaranteed-Hit,\NGuaranteed-Kill
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.40,0:03:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Modern domains have become\Nguaranteed to be deadlier.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:51.79,0:03:59.41,Onscreen1,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&H000000&\bord2\shad0\pos(320,142)}Guaranteed-Hit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.16,0:03:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guarantee was that\Nusers' techniques would
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without question hit their\Ntarget within the domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That used to be the commonplace\Nfunction of domains in the past.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:59.55,0:04:03.68,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\an9\fnComic Sans MS\c&H262912&\fs16\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(617.333,159.333)}You'll lose if you\Ngo out of bounds.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.51,0:04:03.68,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\an8\fnComic Sans MS\c&H262912&\fs16\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(332,213.333)}Same if anything but your\Nsoles touches the ground.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.01,0:04:03.68,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(425,0)\an7\fnComic Sans MS\c&H262912&\fs16\bord0\shad0\b1\pos(78.667,71.333)}Huh?\NSeriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By focusing too hard on\Nthe guaranteed kill aspect,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.40,0:04:11.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorcerers raised the bar on\Nrequirements for constructing a domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,making it a more advanced skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.22,0:04:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with fewer practitioners every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.60,0:04:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means this domain\Nis founded on packs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.76,0:04:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It prevents lethal use,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.04,0:04:26.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prohibits physical harm, and it\Nrequires some explanation of its rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You get one chance to make a statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.30,0:04:33.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same goes for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.32,0:04:38.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After your statement, I will get to\Nmake my rebuttal using this evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.20,0:04:44.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then, Judge Mann will announce his\Nverdict in accordance with the six codes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.66,0:04:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happens if I'm found guilty?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.30,0:04:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I am under no\Nobligation to answer that question,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.84,0:04:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I will at least tell you this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, you have rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If guilty, you have three options.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.61,0:05:00.49,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0\c&H000000&}Silence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, confession, or denial.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.36,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0\c&H000000&}Confession
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.36,0:05:10.37,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0\c&H000000&}Denial
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your denial may include false statements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean I can lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In a court of law?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If everyone told the truth in court,\Nthere would be no need for trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.74,0:05:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, make your argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.38,0:05:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge Man is not very patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.04,0:05:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did go to that pachinko parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I totally played some games.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I even won some.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't avoid lying if I still\Nwant to claim my innocence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So naturally, what I\Nneed to consider is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what could be in that evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:45.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no guarantee that this will confirm\Nthe charges alleged against you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if that evidence doesn't prove\NI entered the pachinko parlor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.62,0:05:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need to deny it or remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.50,0:05:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.38,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,274)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0}Itadori "No!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.82,0:05:56.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, if the evidence only\Nproves I entered the parlor,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can I say it was for another reason?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.88,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,274)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fs22}Itadori "I just borrowed their bathroom."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.74,0:06:00.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just went in to use their bathroom.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.88,0:06:03.47,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,274)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fs22}Higuruma "So you did enter it, then!"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.98,0:06:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if the evidence\Nturns out to be a bust,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.47,0:06:07.88,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,274)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fs22}Itadori "Y-Yes..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.54,0:06:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I might be digging my own grave by\Nadmitting I definitely entered the parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.04,0:06:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if the evidence proves I not only entered\Nthe parlor, but also played the games,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm basically screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I regret it!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.02,0:06:22.52,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,270)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fs22}Itadori "I regret it..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.30,0:06:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if confessing\Nlightens my sentence?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.16,0:06:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, does this court even\Noffer lighter punishments?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.64,0:06:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I confess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.72,0:06:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact is, I entered\Nthe pachinko parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.66,0:06:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it was only because I needed to poop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I had to use their bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going with option two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this court\Naccepts extenuating circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.44,0:06:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but this excuse is the most relatable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.54,0:06:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.28,0:06:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is security camera footage from\Nthe antique shop near Maji, Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.96,0:07:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The store has an ATM which captured\Nthis image on the day in question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.98,0:07:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Note how striking the\Nresemblance, both face and build,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are a perfect match to Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since he just admitted\Nto entering the parlor,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this photo makes it clear\Nthat his excuse about
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,needing the bathroom isn't\Nworth a roll of toilet paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One can thus reason that\Ndespite being underage,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori entered the parlor with\Nthe intent to play pachinko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then you're saying that's a crime?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.52,0:07:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The parlor had clear\Nposted signs explicitly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:38.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prohibiting minors from\Nentering the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.54,0:07:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are charged with criminal trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Article 130 of the Penal Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Businesses Affecting\NPublic Morals Regulation Act.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't punish minors.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:51.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.75,0:07:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was no way for me\Nto talk my way out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I have gone with Option 3?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:57.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Japan prohibits gambling.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.86,0:08:02.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, parlors and ATMs are\Nseparate legal entities.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes multiple\Nparlors even share ATMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.70,0:08:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were only on trial for\Nentering into Maji Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.64,0:08:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you needed to say was, I'm sorry,\Nbut I don't recognize that parlor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.06,0:08:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that way, you can deny the\Ncharge without lying to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.92,0:08:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, we haven't heard the verdict yet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.94,0:08:28.52,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}"Guilty."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guilty.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.19,0:08:30.32,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}"Confiscation."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confiscation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're back where we started?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.56,0:08:37.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I've been declared guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel any different.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.82,0:08:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.96,0:08:55.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not only can he make it\Nappear and disappear at will,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.64,0:09:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he can alter its size too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're pretty tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least I still have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:13.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I can't control my cursed energy.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.61,0:09:20.95,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.88,0:09:24.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Law Apprenticeship Period 59.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.74,0:09:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Iwate Bar Association's\NHiromi Higuruma, age 36.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.44,0:09:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He easily cleared all obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:36.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like the entry exam to Tokyo\NUniversity's School of Law and the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.84,0:09:40.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,old bar exam that preceded the\Ninstitution of the law school system.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.00,0:09:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To Higuruma,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it was all a matter of simply\Ninputting and outputting the necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.16,0:09:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,knowledge that was needed for each\Nindividual task in front of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.60,0:09:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His peers whispered in the hallways behind
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.08,0:09:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his back that he was\Na genius of some kind.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:54.98,0:09:59.73,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\frx322\fry0\fnArial\b1\fax-.1\c&H559E46&\bord0\shad0\3c&HFFFFFF&\3a&H66&\pos(296.666,274.667)}Higuruma {\fax0}La{\fax.1}w Office
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.22,0:10:00.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the gem that shone brightest\Nfrom his unlimited potential
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.34,0:10:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was his overwhelming talent\Nas a Jujutsu sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This technique came with\Nhis domain by default,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but through analyzing his domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:14.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he also learned the fundamentals\Nof how barriers work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.48,0:10:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, working backwards from barriers,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.14,0:10:23.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he intuitively gathered how to manipulate\Ncursed energy for physical enhancement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.46,0:10:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And within 12 days of\Nawakening as a sorcerer,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.42,0:10:29.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his powers had grown to\Nmatch those of a grade 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.34,0:10:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before entering the colony,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma exercised many cursed spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.54,0:10:39.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he struck down over 20 players who\Nhad the misfortune of attacking him first.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lost the ability to\Ncontrol Cursed Energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you take it from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The penalty of confiscation\Nmakes it temporarily
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.60,0:11:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,impossible to use one's Cursed Technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm guessing you've never had\Na cursed technique to begin with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.92,0:11:38.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be why the penalty switched\Nto blocking the use of cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.12,0:11:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coincidentally,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.03,0:11:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,confiscation is generally a supplementary\Nsentence never imposed on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terrifying to think\Nabout how good he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can he hold his own against\Nme without cursed energy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using his natural physical\Nprowess, not his might as a sorcerer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.24,0:12:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have incredibly\Nhigh physical durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.90,0:12:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When sorcerers lose the\Nuse of their technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they often struggle with\Nbasic Cursed Energy control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their instincts probably dull\Nover the many long years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.94,0:12:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the complete inability to use Cursed\NEnergy is even more disadvantageous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.44,0:12:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet he can still fight this\Nwell under these circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first strike would have usually\Nsettled the battle against most foes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not careful, I'll trip me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.72,0:12:28.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush him with my full might!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.54,0:13:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like I'm fighting\Nan unbreakable doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.64,0:13:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit, shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:18.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will this last?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.30,0:13:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need my cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.88,0:13:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got such a strong ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be something I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.50,0:13:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something that puts\NHiguruma at a disadvantage!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.50,0:13:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think? Think!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A technique for court trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.20,0:13:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trials!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.14,0:13:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.28,0:13:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want a retrial!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:02.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.12,0:14:03.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get a second trial, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.98,0:14:09.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as the targeted defendant\Nnever actually admitted their guilt,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.18,0:14:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even after having previously been found
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guilty and subjected to\Npenalty by Judge Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they are entitled to\Ndemand up to two retrials.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judge Man is incapable of\Nrefusing such a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.52,0:14:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand a do-over!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.50,0:14:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The court calls Yuji Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stand accused of mass murder in\NShibuya on the night of Halloween,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.88,0:14:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,October City, 2018.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I killed all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.46,0:14:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to deny it.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.78,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(324,300)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}"Guilty."
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.78,0:14:52.78,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}"Confiscation."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guilty! Confiscation!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Penalty!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.78,0:14:54.28,Main,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,300)\fs18\fnTimes New Roman\bord0\shad0}"Death Penalty."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.00,0:15:08.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoshizawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.91,0:15:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've already submitted the proposal.\NIf that's what you're here about.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.22,0:15:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm not here about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.36,0:15:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took a look at the documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.98,0:15:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good enough as is for the\Njudge to use in his sentencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.78,0:15:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wanted to be either a public prosecutor\Nor a defense lawyer, is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.18,0:15:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would you feel about\Nbecoming a judge instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heaviest sentence Judge\NMan can impose on the guilty
Dialogue: 1,0:15:47.88,0:15:54.76,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\3a&H00&\fs24\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs20\bord1\3a&HBB\be2&}"Executioner's Sword"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is confiscation accompanied\Nby the death penalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.20,0:15:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Confiscation makes it impossible for\Nthe guilty party to use their technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or in Itadori's case,\Ncontrol his cursed energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.00,0:16:07.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As prosecutor, Higuruma is\Ngranted the executioner's sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.84,0:16:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone cut by the\NExecutioner's sword will,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.08,0:16:16.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without exception, meet\Ntheir untimely death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being empathetic to another person's\Nfeelings means understanding their weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.94,0:16:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weakness of victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.34,0:16:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weakness of criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.96,0:16:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Day after day after day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.34,0:16:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so fed up with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:36.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I started to think every time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to help someone\Nwho needed a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you, Itadori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.50,0:16:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All people are weak and ugly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how much you long\Nfor them to have noble souls!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.86,0:16:58.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing for you down that path!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.32,0:17:00.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness before you is just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you shine a light on it,\Nyou'll just find blinding nothingness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to become a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.82,0:17:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.73,0:17:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I ask why you feel this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All people are weak and ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.38,0:17:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in promotions,\Nso I'm not cut out for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.16,0:17:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, at the time, at\Nleast up until that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.56,0:17:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believed that the very\Ndepravity which no other
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.90,0:17:48.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures possessed was\Nmeant to be cherished.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.20,0:17:54.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuji Itadori, why did\Nyou admit your guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:58.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evidence that Judge Man\Nsubmits is shared with the sorcerer
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.88,0:18:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before it is revealed to the defendant\Nduring the course of the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.86,0:18:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The evidence Judge-Man provided was about\Nthe demon harbored inside you, Sukuna!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.30,0:18:14.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Penal Code Article 39, Clause 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being deprived of either\Nsound judgment or control
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.40,0:18:47.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of one's actions qualifies\Nas non-compost mentis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.52,0:18:53.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That night in Shibuya, Sukuna took\Ncontrol of your body, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.66,0:18:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know about Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:19:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words, you lacked\Ncontrol of your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.64,0:19:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't voluntarily\Nsurrender control either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.28,0:19:08.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so, you're innocent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.28,0:19:10.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've committed no crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless of all that,\Nit's still my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.64,0:19:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was too weak to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.76,0:19:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.16,0:19:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaruma, why did you release\Nyour technique just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.64,0:19:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted to return to my roots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, there may still be plenty of\Npeople who are weak and ugly like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wandering around out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your shirt back on, then have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you my hundred points.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori, have you ever killed someone\Nby your own will and not a Sukuna?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.98,0:20:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.74,0:20:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.80,0:20:27.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't it feel awful?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.90,0:20:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.30,0:20:58.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.70,0:21:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.90,0:21:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's not a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.42,0:21:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:30.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all for the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to leave you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.84,0:21:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.76,0:21:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm scared of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.56,0:21:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.78,0:21:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.96,0:21:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.44,0:21:47.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm not in the corner of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.32,0:21:48.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.76,0:21:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, add a new rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.98,0:22:06.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make possible the transfer\Nof points between players.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.72,0:22:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.92,0:22:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this should count toward the change in\Npoints mentioned in rule number eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.84,0:22:14.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Approved! Rule added.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.43,0:22:16.64,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\3a&H00&}9: Players shall be able to view the \Nfollowing information on other players:\Nname, points, number of \Nrules added, current Colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.76,0:22:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.80,0:22:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players are able to\Ntransfer a number of points
Dialogue: 1,0:22:16.64,0:22:21.19,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,0)\3a&H00&}Rule 10: Players are able to\Ntransfer a number of points\Nof their choosing to other Players.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of their choosing to\Nother players in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.50,0:22:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane, give one of my points to Itadori.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:27.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.42,0:22:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have been granted one\Npoint by Hiromi Higuruma.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.68,0:22:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now neither of us will have to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our techniques being stripped for 19 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.22,0:22:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.62,0:22:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higuruma, what are you planning to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.50,0:22:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could join us if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.16,0:22:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be stronger with your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.42,0:22:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My two remaining points\Nare from the judge and
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.86,0:22:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,prosecutor that I killed\Nbefore coming to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.78,0:23:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the barriers open up, I\Nthink I might turn myself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.26,0:23:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll think\Nabout what I should do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.30,0:23:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if I stay with you, I'm\Nlikely to hate myself even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.90,0:23:13.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm not criticizing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.34,0:23:16.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.93,0:23:39.96,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Next Episode\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 4
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.86,0:23:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

